flowchart TD
    Input["Features x"] --> Linear["Linear Combination\nz = w^T x + b"]
    Linear --> Sigmoid["Sigmoid Function\nσ(z) = 1 / (1 + e^-z)"]
    Sigmoid --> Prob["Probability\nP(y=1|x) between 0 and 1"]
    Prob --> Threshold{"Threshold\n≥ 0.5?"}
    Threshold -->|Yes| Pos["Predict: Positive\n(Class 1)"]
    Threshold -->|No| Neg["Predict: Negative\n(Class 0)"]

    Prob --> Loss["Cross-Entropy Loss\nL = -y log(p) - (1-y) log(1-p)"]
    Loss --> Gradient["Gradient Descent\nUpdate weights"]

    style Input fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,color:#000
    style Sigmoid fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#000
    style Prob fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,color:#000
    style Threshold fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2,color:#000
